# This public repository is code-and-documentation only.
# Ignore everything first, then allow only reviewed public files.
*

# Repository metadata and documentation
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README.ko.md
!/README.en.md

# Documentation and user-supplied screenshots
